n torturing:a mouse, a cat is brutish, & a person brutal. For comparison of brutal, see -ER & -EST, 4.
===
with humanity. In torturing a mouse, a cat is *brutish*, & a person *brutal*. For comparison of *brutal*, see ^^-ER^^ & ^^-EST^^, 4.
>>>

